<Positioned left="48" top="1320"><Container width="1104" color="#FFFFFF" borderRadius="14" border="1 SOLID #E1E7F0" padding="24"><Column crossAxisAlignment="START" mainAxisSize="MIN"><Text fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" fontSize="20" color="#2563EB" fontStyle="BOLD" letterSpacing="1">可复现交付</Text><SizedBox height="8"/><Text fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" fontSize="22" color="#334155">检查最终图像素、文字与边界；保存同一份 DSL 与真实服务响应。本文示例的完整源码与独立渲染见 example-04.png。</Text></Column></Container></Positioned>
